          "A sitemap entry",
          "A canonical tag",
          "A nofollow link",
          "An H1 heading"
        ],
        "answer": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "q2",
        "text": "A searcher types \"best running shoes 2024\". What is the dominant search intent?",
