          "Transactional",
          "Commercial investigation",
          "Informational"
        ],
        "answer": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "q3",
        "text": "Which Core Web Vital measures visual stability?",
        "options": ["LCP", "INP", "CLS", "TTFB"],
        "answer": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "q4",
        "text": "What does a 301 response tell a crawler?",
        "options": [
          "The page moved permanently",
          "The page is temporarily unavailable",
          "The page should not be indexed",
          "The page requires authentication"
        ],
        "answer": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "q5",
        "text": "Structured data is added to a page mainly to:",
        "options": [
          "Improve page load time",
          "Describe the content so it can qualify for rich results",
          "Block competitors from scraping",
          "Replace the meta description"
        ],
        "answer": 1
      }
    ]
